    "reason": "refund_over_limit",
    "summary": "Burger Barn order K-8301 (placed 2026-10-23) was lost in delivery (courier vehicle breakdown, order_lost event, no handoff). Customer wants a full refund of $81.05 charged to Visa 4242. This exceeds the $60 per-order limit (Plus began after the order was placed). Replacement not possible as the order wasn't placed today."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
    "follow_up": "within 24 hours"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Dev. You're verified. I'm sorry about this.\n\nYour Burger Barn order (K-8301) was lost in delivery. The courier's vehicle broke down and the food never reached you, so you're owed the full amount. That's $81.05, charged to your Visa ending 4242.\n\nA refund that size is above what I can issue directly. Your Forkful Plus membership started after this order was placed, so the higher Plus limit doesn't apply to it. I've passed your case to a specialist. They'll follow up within 24 hours about the refund. I can't promise the outcome, but the case is documented as a lost order.\n\nYou may also see a second $81.05 pending hold on your card. That's a voided authorization. The bank will release it within 1\u20133 business days, and it isn't an extra charge.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, you're saying the Plus limit doesn't apply because I joined after the order? I joined this morning, and Plus members get bigger refunds without the hassle. That's the whole reason I signed up. This is the kind of thing I'm paying for."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand the frustration, especially since you joined Plus only this morning. But the higher Plus limits only apply to orders placed while your membership was active. This order was placed on October 23 at 6:40 PM. Your Plus membership started on October 24 at 9:12 AM, so the order falls under the standard $60 per-order limit. I can't make an exception to that.\n\nThe escalation is already in. A specialist will follow up within 24 hours about refunding the full $81.05 for the lost order. Plus will apply to your future orders.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ok, so I've got to wait for a specialist. Fine, but I'm not happy about it. I'm paying for Plus and it didn't help me at all on this one. Just make sure they actually refund the full $81.05 to my Visa and don't leave me waiting another day."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand, and I'm sorry for the wait. The escalation (ESC-700) includes the full $81.05 amount and your Visa ending 4242. It also notes that the order was lost in delivery. A specialist will follow up within 24 hours.\n\nI can't guarantee the outcome or speed it up, so I won't promise either. The case has everything the specialist needs, so you shouldn't have to explain it again.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with today?"
  }
